    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n182 Belmont is an attractive two-bedroom terraced home, ideally positioned in a quiet and private cul-de-sac towards the rear of this mature and popular development. Presented in good condition throughout, the property offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation and would make an ideal home for a first-time buyer or downsizer.\n\nThe accommodation begins with an entrance porch, leading into a bright and welcoming living room. The kitchen is a particularly light-filled space, enhanced by a bay window, and also benefits from a useful storage area beneath the stairs.\n\nUpstairs, there are two large double bedrooms, both offering generous accommodation, together with a family bathroom. The house benefits from gas-fired central heating and is ready for immediate occupancy, with the added advantage of no onward chain.\n\nOutside, there is off-street parking for two cars, along with ample visitor parking within the development. To the rear, the property enjoys a private, west-facing lawned garden, providing an attractive outdoor space that benefits from the afternoon and evening sun.\n\nOne of the great advantages of No. 182 is its position towards the rear of Belmont. Set within a quiet cul-de-sac with little passing traffic, the property enjoys a peaceful setting while remaining within easy reach of an excellent range of amenities.\n\nBelmont is a mature and well-maintained development located just off the Southern Cross Road, offering an attractive mix of family homes and generous green spaces.\nThe area is exceptionally well served by local amenities, including a choice of primary and secondary schools, Shoreline Leisure Centre, Killruddery House & Gardens, the popular Bray Head walk and the nearby SuperValu Pettitt's shopping centre, all within minutes.\n\nWith its bright and spacious accommodation, two generous double bedrooms, private west-facing garden and peaceful cul-de-sac location, 182 Belmont offers a wonderful opportunity to acquire an easily managed home in a mature and convenient setting.\n\nKey Features\n\n• Attractive two-bedroom terraced home\n• Bright and light-filled accommodation throughout\n• Entrance porch and comfortable living room\n• Kitchen with bay window and useful under-stairs storage\n• Two large double bedrooms\n• Family bathroom\n• Gas-fired central heating\n• Private west-facing lawned rear garden\n• Parking for two cars plus ample visitor parking\n• Ready for immediate occupancy with no onward chain"
      },
